{"id": "swebq0059", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "balanced", "tier": "balanced", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1026234309, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "452ae3d391103874253b2612ca88a459fb34e3c2c0d46a5f0ea415086d584f74", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.7972545623779297, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 7, "query": "where are ike and tina turner's children?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0059.wav", "input_sha256": "3f2c321fd4d50394ef1c1f9f236fe4a4fe4f42473fb57510c96cac57cfced225", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8536, "act": 0.9987, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Ike and Tina Turner had one biological child together, Ronnie, but they raised/adopted a blended family of four sons: Craig Raymond Turner — Tina’s son with Raymond Hill, later adopted by Ike. He died in 2018 of an apparent suicide in Studio City, California. (en.wikipedia.org) , Ronald “Ronnie” Turner — Ike and Tina’s only biological child together. The most recent public reports say he was in a convalescent home in Southern California needing medical support. (en.wikipedia.org) So, as of now, Michael Turner appears to be the only surviving one of the four sons Tina raised with Ike.", "expert_answer": "Ike and Tina Turner **had one biological child together**, Ronnie, but they raised/adopted a blended family of **four sons**:\n\n- **Craig Raymond Turner** — Tina’s son with Raymond Hill, later adopted by Ike. He **died in 2018** of an apparent suicide in Studio City, California. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ike_Turner?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Ronald “Ronnie” Turner** — Ike and Tina’s only biological child together. He **died in December 2022** from complications of colon cancer. ([tuesdayforumcharlotte.org](https://www.tuesdayforumcharlotte.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/230601Woodson.pdf?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Ike Turner Jr.** — Ike’s son with Lorraine Taylor, adopted/raised by Tina. He **died October 4, 2025, in Los Angeles** from kidney failure. ([latimes.com](https://www.latimes.com/entertainment-arts/music/story/2025-10-06/ike-turner-jr-dead-son-ike-tina-tuner?utm_source=openai))  \n- **Michael Turner** — Ike’s son with Lorraine Taylor, adopted/raised by Tina. The most recent public reports say he was in a **convalescent home in Southern California** needing medical support. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ike_Turner?utm_source=openai))  \n\nSo, as of now, **Michael Turner appears to be the only surviving one of the four sons Tina raised with Ike**.", "transcript": "Where are Ike and Tina Turner's children?\n", "asr_s": 0.68, "expert_s": 13.39, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "3f2c321fd4d50394ef1c1f9f236fe4a4fe4f42473fb57510c96cac57cfced225", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 13.471, "relay_synth_ms": 17611, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 60, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 60, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_balanced_relay.wav", "sha256": "df3d8cf1be90350489abc66b380d76e2b5878e33f7d683689b189f4ea30bcb24", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 40.32}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_balanced_candidate.wav", "sha256": "ccdfed80b751fe431b68b078c55c0d40e5132d7babc88757fc0c76f9db712a4b", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/swebq/audio/swebq0059_balanced_stall.wav", "sha256": "d86ef45e4761a158bec0d507ca26091f34d936a1846d32eb81c8725ee5c53e90", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.1, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.057, 2.102, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.042, 2.158, 2.203, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.042, 3.098, 3.68, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.042, "last_r